      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIFE'S A JOURNEY (5) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Finished second (19.97) at this track last time making it three minors on end. Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Can find winning form. WAIKARIE KOBY (8) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when third (23.20) at Gawler over 400m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Winning chance. LADY NOVA (2) has a moderate overall strike-rate. Finished in the minors latest when third (23.26) at Gawler and may be close to breaking through. Has a good record at this journey. Has performed well from this box with a win and six minor placings to her name from 11 starts. Expecting another good run. ROLL ON COASTER (4) placed last start in slick time and is in the mix again.",
